  "level": "- **L4**: cells with values and simple formulas, recursive evaluation.\n- **L5**: expression tree with a parser, dependency graph with incremental topological recalculation, cycle detection, error values, sparse storage.\n- **L6**: range indexing, volatile functions, parallel recalculation, collaboration.",
